query TT
EXPLAIN
SELECT "URL", COUNT(*) AS PageViews FROM hits WHERE "CounterID" = 62 AND "EventDate" >= '2013-07-01' AND "EventDate" <= '2013-07-31' AND "IsRefresh" = 0 AND "IsLink" <> 0 AND "IsDownload" = 0 GROUP BY "URL" ORDER BY PageViews DESC LIMIT 10 OFFSET 1000;
----
logical_plan
01)Limit: skip=1000, fetch=10
02)--Sort: pageviews DESC NULLS FIRST, fetch=1010
03)----Projection: hits.URL, count(Int64(1)) AS count(*) AS pageviews
04)------Aggregate: groupBy=[[hits.URL]], aggr=[[count(Int64(1))]]
05)--------Projection: hits.URL
06)----------Filter: hits.CounterID = Int32(62) AND hits.EventDate >= TimestampMicrosecond(1372636800000000, None) AND hits.EventDate <= TimestampMicrosecond(1375228800000000, None) AND hits.IsRefresh = Int16(0) AND hits.IsLink != Int16(0) AND hits.IsDownload = Int16(0)
07)------------TableScan: hits projection=[EventDate, CounterID, URL, IsRefresh, IsLink, IsDownload], partial_filters=[hits.CounterID = Int32(62), hits.EventDate >= TimestampMicrosecond(1372636800000000, None), hits.EventDate <= TimestampMicrosecond(1375228800000000, None), hits.IsRefresh = Int16(0), hits.IsLink != Int16(0), hits.IsDownload = Int16(0)]
physical_plan
01)GlobalLimitExec: skip=1000, fetch=10
02)--SortPreservingMergeExec: [pageviews@1 DESC], fetch=1010
03)----ProjectionExec: expr=[URL@0 as URL, count(Int64(1))@1 as pageviews]
04)------SortExec: TopK(fetch=1010), expr=[count(Int64(1))@1 DESC], preserve_partitioning=[true]
05)--------AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[URL@0 as URL], aggr=[count(Int64(1))]
06)----------RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([URL@0], 4), input_partitions=4
07)------------AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[URL@0 as URL], aggr=[count(Int64(1))]
08)--------------DataSourceExec: file_groups={4 groups: [[${WORK_DIR}/hits.vortex:<slt:ignore>], [${WORK_DIR}/hits.vortex:<slt:ignore>], [${WORK_DIR}/hits.vortex:<slt:ignore>], [${WORK_DIR}/hits.vortex:<slt:ignore>]]}, projection=[URL], file_type=vortex, predicate: CounterID@6 = 62 AND EventDate@5 >= 1372636800000000 AND EventDate@5 <= 1375228800000000 AND IsRefresh@15 = 0 AND IsLink@52 != 0 AND IsDownload@53 = 0
